        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    monthly_payment = 500\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.06\n    monthly_interest_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    number_of_periods = 10 * 12\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    future_value = (\n        monthly_payment\n        * (((1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** number_of_periods - 1) / monthly_interest_rate)\n        * (1 + monthly_interest_rate)\n    )\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(future_value)\n```",
